/**
 * Deterministic learning-path generator.
 *
 * This is the piece the README promises ("deterministic, capacity-aware
 * learning paths ... generated by Gemma 4 backend tools") but that wasn't
 * actually implemented — chatService.js was returning the same 3 generic
 * bullets for every track and level. This file replaces that placeholder
 * with real, distinct curricula per track x level.
 *
 * Kept deterministic on purpose: Gemma/the agent decides WHICH track and
 * level apply to this user (via inferTrackFromMessage / inferLevelFromMessage),
 * but the actual path CONTENT is a fixed, reviewable lookup table rather than
 * something the model freely generates each time. That means the same
 * track+level always produces the same path (predictable, testable, no
 * hallucinated steps), while Gemma selects the track and level through a
 * native function call and drives the conversation around the grounded result.
 * Deterministic inference remains only as a safety fallback if the call fails.
 */

